BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Brown County Playhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261204T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261204T220000
DTSTAMP:20261125T011528Z
CREATED:20260930T190820Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261125T011528Z
UID:10001524-1796412600-1796421600@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:White Christmas [Live Musical Theatre]
DESCRIPTION:Irving Berlin’s White Christmas is a heartwarming stage musical about two World War II army veterans turned song-and-dance partners who team up with a sister act to save a struggling Vermont lodge owned by their former general. \n\n\n\n\n\nCAST LIST \n\nBOB WALLACE – Alexus McLeod \nPHIL DAVIS – Romeo Morgan \nBETTY HAYNES – Jessica Pumo \nJUDY HAYNES – Anna Bratton \nGENERAL WAVERLY – Ed Phillips \nMARTHA WATSON – Nicole Cunningham \nSUSAN WAVERLY – Kaira Lammers \nRALPH SHELDRAKE/EZIKIEL FOSTER/SNORING MAN – Brian Heaton \nRITA – Sidney Bolam \nRHODA – Erin Rudich \nDANCE CAPTAIN – Ben Richards \nMURIEL (STAGE MANAGER) – Muriel Mackie \nJIMMY/TRAIN CONDUCTOR/ED SULLIVAN ANNOUNCER/REGENCY ROOM ANNOUNCER – Tom Preston \nCIGARETTE GIRL – Chloe Allen \nTESSIE/MRS. SNORING MAN/SEAMSTRESS – Julie Miller \nASSISTANT SEAMSTRESS/SHELDRAKE’S SECRETARY – Amanda Middleton \nSWINGS – Dereck Middleton\, Ben Richards \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBUY TICKETS - Friday Dec 4 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Saturday Dec 5 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Sunday Dec 6 - 2:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Friday Dec 11 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Saturday Dec 12 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Sunday Dec 13 - 2:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Friday Dec 18 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Saturday Dec 19 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Sunday Dec 20 - 2:30pm
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/white-christmas-live-musical-theatre/2026-12-04/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Event,Live Shows,Play,Theatre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-WhiteChristmas-WEB.jpg
END:VEVENT
