CREATED:20261127T050100Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261125T013440Z
UID:10001554-1801855800-1801855800@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:Grease Radio Play
DESCRIPTION:It’s 1959 at Rydell High\, and greaser Danny Zuko and sweet new girl Sandy Olsson are trying to figure out if their summer romance can survive senior year. Told as an old-time radio play with live sound effects\, this fan-favorite musical is packed with the songs\, the attitude and the leather jackets you love. Grab your poodle skirt and come along for the ride! \nTickets - Friday\, Feb 5\, 7:30pm\n\nTickets - Saturday\, Feb 6\, 7:30pm\n\nTickets - Sunday\, Feb 7\, 2:30pm
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/grease-radio-play-2027/2027-02-05/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Event,Live Shows,Radio Play
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2027-Grease_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
